      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Firestore**\n\nI've decided to use Firebase Firestore as the external provider for the NoSQL document store. This choice is based on its managed nature and suitability for JSON document upserts. The next step is to make it identifiable in the code.\n\n\n**Defining the File**\n\nI'm now creating the `upsert_document.py` file to hold the upsert logic. This includes the essential imports for `firebase_admin` and `firestore`. I've added the initial Firebase app initialization code, anticipating that the project ID will eventually come from configuration. The next step is fleshing out the `upsert_document` function, which will handle the actual upsert operation.\n\n\n",
